This is a '''list of quotes by {{ai|Neon}}'''. Neon is voiced by Vanille Velasquez in English. Necessary quotes translated are from Filipino to English. Neon has a total of {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Neon Quotes}} files of quotes including unused and removed lines, and excluding [[#The Range's lore assets|The Range's lore assets]].

A downloadable folder containing all the audio files on this page can be found [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YJ6XuYyLhzrtJqai0_j0UqvN83Ktlph8?usp=sharing here].

